note The default shape: the call tree in pre-order, each symbol once, where a cut callee is left out and a stopped one is kept as a leaf whose own callees are not followed. The root is never cut or stopped. The rules and their thresholds were chosen by scoring against the hand-written feature tours of this repo; the report names every symbol each rule touched so an agent can put one back.

