note The command: index the files the call tree reaches, resolve the symbol to exactly one, hand it to Map::promote with the agent or human as author, and print how many steps the tour now has with what each pruning rule did. The name and depth arrive already converted: the name as a TourName or the MapError that refuses it, the depth as Levels, Map::PROMOTE_DEPTH (2) unless given. A pruned promote first asks the server for every pending file of the root's language, since the accessor and shared rules count callers and a caller in an unindexed file would be missed.

